<title>USA: Fifth Third sees Q3 $0.10/shr SAIF charge.</title>
<headline>Fifth Third sees Q3 $0.10/shr SAIF charge.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fifth Third Bancorp said Thursday it expects a $0.10 per share reduction in third quarter earnings because of recently-enacted legislation to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>The company said it expects its SAIF contribution to come to a one-time pre-tax charge of $16.6 million.</p>
<p>Fifth Third said it expects its ongoing deposit insurance premiums will be reduced by $6.1 million annually.</p>
</text>
